    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have a data protection agreement template (DPA v3.2) in place, and we are aware of the requirements for GDPR compliance, including data subject rights, data breach notification, and cross-border data transfers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of ensuring that we contract meets EU jurisdiction requirements, we can include clauses that specify the applicable law and jurisdiction, as well as any necessary provisions for dispute resolution. our company context indicates that we have experience with public procurement in EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while there are legal risks associated with GDPR compliance and automated decision-making, our company context suggests that we have the necessary policies and procedures in place to mitigate legal risks associated with GDPR compliance and automated decision-making and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years and expects the annual cost of exploitation to remain mastered." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose to ensure compatibility with The client budgetary capacities?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have a target gross margin percentage of 28% and a minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate our projected margin on this contract, our would need to estimate the total revenue from this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, since our do not have estimate, let's assume that our can achieve our projected margin on this contract. our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, infrastructure margins, software license resale margins, and other factors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, or approximately 750,000 euros per year, our would need to structure our proposal to ensure compatibility with The client budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One potential cost-optimization strategy is to renegotiate rates with subcontractors, as mentioned in our cost sensitivity section. renegotiate could help our absorb some costs and maintain profitability while staying within The client budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific details on the project scope and requirements, it's challenging to provide a precise estimate of our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, our could also consider proposing a phased implementation approach, as mentioned in the knowledge graph, with a pilot phase on a limited scope and progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would allow our to better manage costs, ensure quality, and adapt to The client needs while staying within The client budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific numbers, if our assume that our total revenue from this contract is approximately 750,000 euros per year, and applying our target gross margin percentage of 28%, our projected margin would be around 210,000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, please note that around 210,000 euros per year is a rough estimate and may vary depending on various factors, including the actual project scope, resource allocation, and cost structure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that provides relevant information, recalls applicable rules, and suggests actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design an AI component that meets these requirements, and what innovation strategy can we propose to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., we can design an AI component that leverages we expertise in LLMs and RAG capabilities to meet The client requirements. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned using methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt to the administrative context and improve performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide relevant information, recall applicable rules, and suggest actions or verifications, we can utilize we RAG capabilities, which include retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search and BM25 sparse search. we chunking strategies, such as recursive text splitter and semantic chunking, can help process and analyze administrative documents and regulations. we innovation strategy to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users involves deploying an AI solution that integrates with existing systems and workflows. we can propose a progressive deployment approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and gradually generalizing to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the solution is explainable and transparent, we can implement techniques like source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. we EU AI Act compliance and GDPR adherence will guarantee the security and privacy of user data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we expertise in AI research and development, particularly in LLMs and RAG, and combining our expertise in AI research and development, particularly in LLMs and RAG with we innovation pipeline focused on knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, we can create a tailored solution that addresses the client's needs and improves the overall efficiency and quality of administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and expects a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we proposed solution meets these sustainability requirements, and what eco-friendly practices can we implement to minimize our environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s CSR & Sustainability Officer, I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s has a strong commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s have already implemented various eco-friendly practices in Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can propose hosting solutions with Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy, can also help reduce energy consumption by up to 35% compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s have a carbon reporting capability based on the GRI Standards (partial), which will enable Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s to monitor and report the carbon footprint of our proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By relying on these infrastructures with low carbon impact and implementing Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s eco-friendly practices, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can ensure that our proposed solution meets The client sustainability requirements and minimizes Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is worth noting that while Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s strive to be as sustainable as possible, I do not have information on the specific environmental footprint of our proposed solution or the exact amount of energetic consumption reduction our proposed solution can achieve in this context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., as the consortium lead, proposes a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our team has extensive experience in managing large-scale projects, particularly in the public sector, and Our are well-equipped to deliver implement within the allocated budget of 3 million euros over 4 years. a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the municipal agents of the City of Belval work environment, capable of accompanying the municipal agents of the City of Belval in the municipal agents of the City of Belval administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will achieve this by leveraging Our expertise in AI research and development, specifically in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval will integrate with existing systems, including business softwares, electronic document management (EDM) systems, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our technical architecture will utilize cloud hosting, API integration, and data engineering to ensure seamless integration and high performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will guarantee a response time of less than 2 seconds and an availability of 99.9%, ensuring that a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval is compatible with daily use by the municipal agents of the City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the City of Belval concerns about data sovereignty, Our will host a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval on SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, which aligns with Our existing capabilities and ensures data residency within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will also implement robust security measures, including encryption and anonymization, to protect sensitive data. a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval will be designed with explicability and transparency in mind, allowing for a posteriori understanding of the elements that led to an answer or suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will also ensure that no decision is automated without explicit validation by an agent, guaranteeing that a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval is used as a tool of assistance rather than a substitute for human judgment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of project management, Our will employ Our proven methodologies, including PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe, to structure implement into manageable phases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will establish a steering committee to oversee implement progress, make key decisions, and ensure that a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) system of assistance to the municipal agents of the City of Belval aligns with the City of Belval expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
