    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, Our propose a phased implementation approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and progressively generalizing to the entirety of the services. a phased implementation approach will enable Our to better manage costs, ensure quality, and adapt to the City of Belval needs while staying within the City of Belval budgetary capacities." ;
